# data.sha256: the clips and vahash that the native cases video/* read from
# the Lenovo's data partition, /dev/disk0p6, in native/video/clips, in
# `sha256sum -c` form with names relative to that directory. vahash was
# built on the Lenovo's Debian 13.7 against FFmpeg 7.1.5's headers of the
# snapshot the GNU root pins, and the MPEG-2 and JPEG clips were made there
# by `video-gpu.sh make`, in the boot whose output is linux.tar.gz.
